{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47211","headline":"柳 · 慕幽","name":"柳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今古凭君一赠行，几回折尽复重生。\n五株斜傍渊明宅，千树低垂太尉营。\n临水带烟藏翡翠，倚风兼雨宿流莺。\n隋皇堤畔依依在，曾惹当时歌吹声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慕幽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47211.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47211","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}